@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### Overview and exercise progress (log in using users.rest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/statistics?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-11-12

### All history through this date
GET {{baseUrl}}/statistics?to=2026-11-12

### Empty period
GET {{baseUrl}}/statistics?from=2025-01-01&to=2025-01-31

### Invalid date
GET {{baseUrl}}/statistics?from=2026-02-30&to=2026-11-12

### Reversed range
GET {{baseUrl}}/statistics?from=2026-11-12&to=2026-01-01

### Missing end date
GET {{baseUrl}}/statistics
